<div class="linear-gradient-l flex items-center justify-center gap-8 py-12 pointer-events-auto">
  <div class="container_ pointer-events-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-start gap-8 py-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-8 self-stretch md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-12">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-3 md:w-1/2">
          <div class="text-[34px] font-bold uppercase leading-none tracking-tight text-red-logo sm:text-[40px] md:text-[52px] lg:text-5xl">Architecture</div>
          <div class="font-inter text-xl font-medium italic leading-normal text-grey-600 sm:text-2xl">meets</div>
          <div class="text-[34px] font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-grey-logo sm:text-[40px] md:text-[52px] lg:text-5xl">wroclove.rb</div>
          <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 border border-red-logo px-2 py-1">
            <div class="font-inter text-sm font-medium uppercase leading-tight text-red-logo">15th anniversary edition</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 self-stretch font-inter text-md font-medium leading-normal text-grey-600 md:w-1/2 md:justify-center">
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-grey-logo">15 years of wroclove.rb calls for something special!</p>
          <p>
            Architecture has always been part of our DNA. For 15 years, wroclove.rb has brought together people who love building software, sharing ideas, and exploring everything from software design and system architecture to the craft
            of writing great code. And all this time, we've been surrounded by the beautiful architecture of Wrocław. After all, those famous Wrocław Manhattan buildings have been with us all along!
          </p>
          <p>
            This year, we want to celebrate both sides of this heritage. So, we're bringing <strong class="text-grey-logo">architecture</strong> into the spotlight. Throughout the conference, you'll experience talks and workshops covering a wide range of areas – from System &amp; Software Architecture and Data Architecture, through Architecture of Scale &amp; Performance, all the way to the Architecture of Code. And nowadays, with more and more work being delegated to agents, having good architectural foundations and clear boundaries to guide that work feels more important than ever.
          </p>
          <p>As a cherry on top, we're also planning social activities around the architecture of Wrocław and its surrounding areas. Let's celebrate 15 years of building things together!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-8 py-12 pointer-events-auto">
  <div class="container_">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-end justify-start gap-4 md:flex-row">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-start gap-3 md:w-1/2">
        <div class="self-stretch text-3xl font-bold leading-10 text-grey-logo">Join as a speaker</div>
        <div class="self-stretch font-inter text-md font-medium leading-normal text-grey-600">
          You might not realize it, but your day-to-day work with Ruby could be groundbreaking to others. Submit your talk proposal for wroclove.rb and share those unique experiences - what seems ordinary to you could be extraordinary
          inspiration for fellow developers.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="button_ w-full md:w-1/2">
        <%= link_to "Join us", "https://forms.gle/LqkMrinw4uNNnQGy9", class: "button_ z-10 mx-auto w-full text-center text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-pointer" %>
        <%#= link_to "CFP opens soon!", "#", class: "button_ z-10 mx-auto w-full text-center text-lg font-bold text-white cursor-default" %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

